#. Tag: title
#: details-schedules.docbook:12
#, no-c-format
msgid "Schedules"
msgstr "Rasporedi"

#. Tag: title
#: details-schedules.docbook:15
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: quote
#: details-schedules.docbook:18
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Schedules maintain information about transactions that occur one or more "
"times over a specified period of time."
msgstr ""
"Rasporedi sadržavaju informacija o transakcijama koje se dešavaju jdnom ili "
"više puta tokom određenog perioda vremena."

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:24
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Sometimes called a recurring transaction, a schedule provides a means to "
"record information about a transaction that happen on a regular basis. A "
"common schedule is your salary. Once a month, or maybe weekly, the company "
"you work for pays you for services rendered. This payment can happen in many "
"different ways, but each month or week you will receive a payment that needs "
"to be recorded."
msgstr ""
"Ponekad nazivana transakcijom koja se ponavlja, raspored pruža način "
"bilježenja informacija o transkaciji koja se dešava s vremena na vrijeme. "
"Uobičajeni izvještaj je vaša plata. Jednom mjesečno, ili možda sedmično, "
"kompanija za koju radite vam plaća za vaš posao. Ova uplata se može "
"realizirati na više različitih načina, ali svakog mjeseca ili sedmice "
"dobićete uplatu koja treba biti zabilježena."

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:33
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Because you know these payments are regularly made to you, you can create a "
"Schedule to record information about the payment and even create the "
"transaction for you when pay day arrives."
msgstr ""
"Zato što znate da vam ove uplate stalno dolaze na račun, možete napraviti "
"Raspored da zabilježite informacije o uplati i čak kreirati transakciju kad "
"dođe dan plate."

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:39
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Other types of schedules can also be recorded to reflect money coming in and "
"out of your accounts. Common expenses, such as utility bills or money "
"transfers, can be recorded with schedules, along with loan repayments. "
"Scheduling a payment can also provide a useful reminder that you need to "
"make a payment."
msgstr ""
"Druge vrste rasporeda su oni koji bilježe priliv i odliv novca sa vaših "
"računa. Česti troškovi, kao što su režije ili prebacivanje novca, također "
"mogu biti zabilježene rasporedima, zajedno sa kreditnim isplatama. "
"Zakazivanje uplate može također poslužiti kao koristan podsjetnik da trebate "
"izvršiti uplatu."

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:47
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A schedule consists of two main parts: the scheduling data and the "
"transaction data. The scheduling data records the occurrence of the "
"schedule, i.e., when the transaction is to be entered into the ledger and "
"how. The transaction data records the normal details about the transaction, "
"and will be entered in to the ledger as-is."
msgstr ""
"Raspored se sastoji od dva glavna dijela: podaci o rasporedu i podaci o "
"transakcijama. Podaci o rasporedu bilježi pojavu rasporeda, naprimjer, kada "
"se transakcija treba unijeti u knjigu salda i kako. Podaci o transakcijama "
"bilježe normalne detalje o transakcijama, i biće uneseni u knjigu salda "
"onakvi kakvi su."

#. Tag: title
#: details-schedules.docbook:57
#, no-c-format
msgid "Types of schedules"
msgstr "Vrste rasporeda"

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:59
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"There are four different types of schedules in the current version of "
"&kappname;:"
msgstr ""
"U trenutnoj verziji &kappname; nalaze se četiri osnovne vrste rasporeda:"

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Bills</para>"
msgstr "<para>Računi</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:66
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Deposits</para>"
msgstr "<para>Depoziti</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:67
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Loans</para>"
msgstr "<para>Krediti</para>"

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:68
#, no-c-format
msgid "<para>Transfers</para>"
msgstr "<para>Transferi</para>"

#. Tag: title
#: details-schedules.docbook:72
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Bills</title>"
msgstr "<title>Računi</title>"

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A Bill Schedule is used for money going out of your account, such as a Gym "
"membership or a utility bill."
msgstr ""
"Raspored računa se koristi za novac koji odlazi sa vašeg računa, kao "
"Članarina za teretanu ili račun za neku od komunalija."

#. Tag: title
#: details-schedules.docbook:81
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Deposits</title>"
msgstr "<title>Depoziti</title>"

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:83
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A Deposit Schedule is for money coming into your account, such as a pay "
"check."
msgstr "Raspored depozita je za novac koji dolazi na vaš račun, kao plata."

#. Tag: title
#: details-schedules.docbook:89
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Loans</title>"
msgstr "<title>Krediti</title>"

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:91
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A Loan Schedule is a special type of schedule and is created when dealing "
"with <link linkend=\"details.loans\">Loan</link> accounts."
msgstr ""
"Raspored kredita je posebna vrsta rasporeda i kreira se prilikom rada sa "
"<link linkend=\"details.loans\">Kredit</link> računima."

#. Tag: title
#: details-schedules.docbook:98
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Transfers</title>"
msgstr "<title>Transferi</title>"

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:100
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A Transfer Schedule is used for money coming out of one account and going "
"into another, such as making a credit card payment from your checking "
"account."
msgstr ""
"Raspored transfera se koristi za novac koji odlazi sa jednog računa i odlazi "
"na drugi, kao što je plaćanje računa za kreditnu karticu sa vašeg čekovnog "
"računa."

#. Tag: title
#: details-schedules.docbook:109
#, no-c-format
msgid "The schedule view"
msgstr "Pregled rasporeda"

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:111
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Open the schedule view by clicking on the <guiicon>Schedule "
"<inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"schedule_view.png\"/></"
"imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> icon in the view selector."
msgstr ""
"Otvorite pregled rasporeda klikom na <guiicon>Raspored "
"<inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"schedule_view.png\"/></"
"imageobject></inlinemediaobject></guiicon> ikonu u izborniku pregleda."

#. Tag: phrase
#: details-schedules.docbook:125
#, no-c-format
msgid "Schedule View"
msgstr "Pregled rasporeda"

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:131
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The schedule view consists of a view area with two tabs along with a "
"<guibutton>New Schedule</guibutton> button above it. The first tab "
"<guibutton>List View</guibutton> shows all schedules, grouped by type. The "
"second tab <guibutton>Calendar View</guibutton> is described in its own "
"section below."
msgstr ""
"Pregleda rasporeda se sastoji od preglednog područja zajedno sa "
"<guibutton>New Schedule</guibutton> tipkom iznad. Prva kartica "
"<guibutton>Listni Pregled</guibutton> prikazuje sve rasporede, grupisane po "
"vrsti. Druga kartica <guibutton>Pregled kalendara</guibutton> je opisana u "
"svom dijelu ispod."

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:139
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To create a new schedule click on the button. For Bill, Deposit, and "
"Transfer schedules, &kappname; will display the new schedule dialog. Loan "
"schedules are handled differently, and are described in the section on Loans."
msgstr ""
"Za kreiranje novog rasporeda kliknite na tipku. Za rasporede računa, "
"depozita i transfera, &kappname;  će prikazati dijalog za novi raspored. "
"Rasporedi kredita se tretiraju drugačije, i opisani su u dijelu o kreditima."

#. Tag: title
#: details-schedules.docbook:147
#, no-c-format
msgid "The new schedule dialog"
msgstr "Dijalog za novi raspored"

#. Tag: phrase
#: details-schedules.docbook:155
#, no-c-format
msgid "New Schedule"
msgstr "Novi raspored"

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:161
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A new dialog window is now shown, prompting for the schedule and transaction "
"data. The requested data includes the following:"
msgstr ""
"Novi prozor za dijalog je sada prikazan, traži informacije o rasporedu i "
"transakcijama. Traženi podaci uključuju sljedeće:"

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:167
#, no-c-format
msgid "Schedule Name"
msgstr "Ime rasporeda"

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:168
#, no-c-format
msgid "Next due date"
msgstr "Sljedeći rok"

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:169
#, no-c-format
msgid "Frequency"
msgstr "Učestanost"

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:170
#, no-c-format
msgid "Payment method"
msgstr "Način plaćanja"

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:171
#, no-c-format
msgid "Amount"
msgstr "Iznos"

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:172
#, no-c-format
msgid "Other transaction details"
msgstr "Ostali detalji o transakciji"

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:173
#, no-c-format
msgid "Schedule options"
msgstr "Opcije rasporeda"

#. Tag: title
#: details-schedules.docbook:177
#, no-c-format
msgid "Filling in the fields"
msgstr "Popunjavanje polja"

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:179
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Enter the name and the date of the next occurrence of this schedule into "
"their respective fields. The name is how the schedule will be shown in the "
"list view. Specify how often the schedule should occur, using the Frequency "
"field and drop down list. For example \"every 6 weeks\" or \"every 3 months"
"\". If the amount varies transaction to transaction make sure to check the "
"<guilabel>Estimate</guilabel> check box and you will be prompted for the "
"correct amount when it is entered into the ledger. Fill in all the "
"transaction fields as you would normally with the ledger view."
msgstr ""
"Unesite ime i datum sljedećeg pojavljivanja ovog rasporeda u odgovarajuća "
"polja. Ime je način prikaza rasporeda u listnom pregledu. Specificirajte "
"koliko često bi se raspored trebao dešavati, korištenjem polja učestanosti i "
"padajuće liste. Naprimjer \"svakih šest sedmica\" ili \"svaka tri mjeseca\". "
"Ako iznos varira od transakcije do transakcije, osigurajte se da ste "
"zakačili <guilabel>Procjena</guilabel> kontrolni okvir i bićete upitani da "
"unesete tačan iznos kada se bude unosio u knjigu salda. Popunite sva polja "
"za transakcije kako biste i inače uradili u knjizi salda."

#. Tag: title
#: details-schedules.docbook:192
#, no-c-format
msgid "Modifying the schedule behavior"
msgstr "Modifikacija ponašanja rasporeda"

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:193
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"At the bottom of the dialog are some optional fields that can modify how the "
"schedule behaves. If the schedule occurs on a weekend you can choose whether "
"to enter the transaction on the weekend day, the previous Friday, or the "
"next Monday. Typically this option is used to replicate some real world "
"operation such as a bank transaction."
msgstr ""
"Na dnu dijaloga se nalaze neka opcionalna polja koja mogu modificirati kako "
"se raspored ponaša. Ako se raspored desi za vikend možete odabrati želite li "
"unijeti transakciju na dan vikenda, prethodnog petka, ili narednog "
"ponedjeljka. Obično se ova opcija koristi da oponaša neke radnje u stvarnom "
"svijetu kao što je bankovna transakcija."

#. Tag: title
#: details-schedules.docbook:203
#, no-c-format
msgid "Letting &kappname; enter the transaction into the register"
msgstr "Dopuštanje &kappname; unos transakcija u zapisnik"

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:205
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To let &kappname; automatically enter the transaction for you when needed, "
"make sure that the check box labeled <guilabel>Enter this schedule into the "
"ledger automatically when it is due</guilabel> is checked. Otherwise, when "
"the transaction is due to be entered, &kappname; will open a dialog box "
"asking you to confirm that you want it to be entered. This behavior is "
"configurable, and more information can be found in the Settings section."
msgstr ""
"Da biste dopustili &kappname; da automatski unese transakciju za vas kad je "
"potrebno, osigurajte se da ste označili komandni okvir <guilabel>Unesi ovaj "
"raspored u knjigu salda autmotski kada dođe vrijeme za to</guilabel>. U "
"suprotnom, kada dođe vrijeme za unos transakcije, &kappname; će otvoriti "
"dijalog koji će vas pitati da potvrdite da li to želite unijeti. Ovo "
"ponašanje se može konfigurisati, a više informacija može biti pronađeno u "
"dijelu za postavke."

#. Tag: title
#: details-schedules.docbook:216
#, no-c-format
msgid "Letting &kappname; know when the schedule will finish"
msgstr "Davanje do znanja &kappname; kada će raspored završiti"

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:218
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you know how many transactions are left or when they are due to finish, "
"this information can be entered so the transactions are not entered "
"indefinitely. Check the appropriate check box and enter the appropriate "
"information. Only the date or the number of transactions remaining is needed "
"because the other can be calculated."
msgstr ""
"Ako znate koliko transakcija je preostalo ili kada je vrijeme njihovog "
"završetka, ovaj podatak može biti unesen tako da se transakcije ne unose bez "
"ograničenja. Zakačite odgovarajući komandni okvir i unesite odgovarajuće "
"podatke. Potreban je samo datum ili broj transakcija jer ostali podaci mogu "
"biti izračunati."

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:226
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you have entered all the necessary information click on <guibutton>OK</"
"guibutton> to continue."
msgstr ""
"Kada ste unijeli sve potrebne informacije kliknite na <guibutton>U redu</"
"guibutton> za nastavak."

#. Tag: title
#: details-schedules.docbook:235
#, no-c-format
msgid "Editing schedules"
msgstr "Uređivanje rasporeda"

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:237
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To edit a schedule simply select the entry in the list and right click to "
"bring up the context menu and select <guimenuitem>Edit</guimenuitem>. This "
"will bring up a dialog similar to the New Schedule dialog, where you can "
"alter the necessary data."
msgstr ""
"Za uređivanje rasporeda jednostavno odaberite unos iz liste desnim klikom "
"miša da bi se pojavio izbornik i odaberite <guimenuitem>Izmijeni</"
"guimenuitem>.  Ovo će dovesti do prikaza dijaloga sličnog dijalogu za novi "
"raspored, gdje možete promijeniti željene podatke."

#. Tag: title
#: details-schedules.docbook:246
#, no-c-format
msgid "Deleting schedules"
msgstr "Brisanje rasporeda"

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:248
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To delete a schedule simply select the entry in the list and right click to "
"bring up the context menu and select <guimenuitem>Delete</guimenuitem>."
msgstr ""
"Za brisanje rasporeda jednostavno odaberite unos iz liste desnim klikom miša "
"da bi se pojavio izbornik i odaberite <guimenuitem>Obriši</guimenuitem>."

#. Tag: title
#: details-schedules.docbook:255
#, no-c-format
msgid "The calendar view"
msgstr "Kalendarski prikaz"

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:257
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The calendar tab presents the schedules in a calendar format so it is easier "
"to see when they occur. To switch to the calendar view click on the "
"<guibutton>Calendar View</guibutton> tab."
msgstr ""
"Kartica za kalendar prezentuje rasporede u formi kalendara tako da ih je "
"lakše vidjeti kada se dogode. Za prebacivanje na kalenderski prikaz kliknite "
"na <guibutton>Pregled kalendara</guibutton> karticu."

#. Tag: phrase
#: details-schedules.docbook:270
#, no-c-format
msgid "Calendar View"
msgstr "Kalendarski prikaz"

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:276
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The calendar type can be changed using the <guibutton>Select Style</"
"guibutton> button. Currently only two types exist: Week and Month. The "
"monthly view is the default, and is usually the most useful. Navigate "
"through the dates using the controls as you would with the date input "
"control."
msgstr ""
"Vrsta kalendara može biti promijenjena korištenjem <guibutton>Odaberi stil</"
"guibutton> tipke. Trenutno postoje samo dvije vrste: mjesečni i sedmični. "
"Mjesečni prikaz je prikazan pri prvom pokretanju, i obično je najkorisniji. "
"Krećite se kroz datume korištenjem kontrola isto kao što biste koristili "
"kontrole za unos datuma."

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:283
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"On any day with scheduled transactions, the number of transactions scheduled "
"for that day is displayed on the calendar."
msgstr ""
"Za dan za koji su zakazane transakcije, broj transakcija zakazan za taj dan "
"je prikazan na kalendaru."

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:298
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To view the schedule(s) that fall on that day, move the mouse cursor over "
"the highlight and a popup window will be displayed allowing you to view the "
"schedule summary."
msgstr ""
"Za pregled rasporeda koji padaju na taj dan, pomjerite pokazivač miša preko "
"istaknutog dijela i pojavit će se iskačući prozor koji vam dozvoljava "
"pregled sažetka rasporeda."

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:314
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If more than one schedule falls on that day you can cycle through them using "
"the arrow buttons in the upper corners of the popup window."
msgstr ""
"Ako na taj dan pada više od jednog rasporeda, možete se prebacivati sa "
"jednog na drugi korištenjem strelica u gornjim uglovima iskačućeg prozora."

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:319
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you find that the display is cluttered with schedules and you only want "
"to view one type of schedule, then this is possible from the "
"<guibutton>Select Schedules</guibutton> dropdown. After clicking on this "
"button the different schedule types are listed and are checked by default"
msgstr ""
"Ako je ekran prenatrpan rasporedima, a vi želite vidjeti samo jednu vrstu "
"rasporeda, ovo je moguće uraditi iz <guibutton>Odaberi Rasporede</guibutton> "
"opadjućeg izbornika. Nakon klika na ovu tipku, razne vrste rasporeda su "
"izlistane i već su odabrane."

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:336
#, no-c-format
msgid "To remove a type from the calendar view simply uncheck it in the list."
msgstr ""
"Za uklanjanje vrste iz kalendarskog prikaza jednostavno ih otkačite iz liste."

#. Tag: title
#: details-schedules.docbook:343
#, no-c-format
msgid "Entering scheduled transactions"
msgstr "Unos zakazanih transakcija"

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:345
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Entering a scheduled transaction means actually entering a transaction into "
"the appropriate ledger, using the details specified in the schedule. "
"Scheduled transactions can be entered in one of four different ways:"
msgstr ""
"Unos zakazane transakcije je ustvari unos transakcije u odgovarajuću knjigu "
"salda, korištenjem detalja koji su specificirani u rasporedu. Zakazane "
"transakcije mogu biti unesene korištenjem jednog od četiri moguća načina:"

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:352
#, no-c-format
msgid "Manually by right clicking on the list entry"
msgstr "Ručno, desnim klikom na unos u listi"

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:353
#, no-c-format
msgid "Manually via the popup window in the calendar view"
msgstr "Ručno, preko iskačućeg prozora u kalendarskom prikazu"

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:355
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kappname; can enter them with or without your interaction upon startup"
msgstr ""
"&kappname; ih može unijeti sa i ili bez vaše interakcije neposredno poslije "
"starta"

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:360
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kappname; can enter them with your interaction during online banking or "
"import of an electronic bank statement"
msgstr ""
"&kappname; ih može unijeti sa vašom interakcijom tokom online bankarstva ili "
"unosa elektronskog bankovnog izvoda iz računa"

#. Tag: title
#: details-schedules.docbook:368
#, no-c-format
msgid "Manually entering scheduled transactions"
msgstr "Ručni unos zakazanih transakcije"

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:370
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can enter a scheduled transaction manually by right clicking on the list "
"entry and selecting <guimenuitem>Enter</guimenuitem> from the popup menu or "
"by clicking on the <guibutton>Enter</guibutton> button on the popup window "
"in the calendar view."
msgstr ""
"Možete unijeti zakazanu transakciju desnim klikom na unos iz liste odabirom  "
"<guimenuitem>Unesi</guimenuitem> iz iskačućeg izbornika ili klikom na tipku "
"<guibutton>Unesi</guibutton> iz iskačućeg prozora u kalendarskom prikazu."

#. Tag: title
#: details-schedules.docbook:379
#, no-c-format
msgid "Confirming the transaction to enter"
msgstr "Potvrda transakcije za unos"

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:381
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After selecting either method the Enter Scheduled Transaction dialog window "
"is shown prompting you with the required information that was entered when "
"you created the schedule."
msgstr ""
"Poslije odabira bilo kojeg načina, prikazan vam je dijalog za unos zakazane "
"transakcije sa potrebnim podacima koji su uneseni kada je raspored "
"napravljen."

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:397
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This information can be changed, and the changes can be applied to just this "
"one instance of the schedule or to all subsequent transactions. After "
"checking that all the data is correct clicking on <guibutton>OK</guibutton> "
"will add the transaction to the ledger and update the next due date of the "
"schedule to the next occurrence. If you have changed any of the transaction "
"data a further confirmation of what you changed will be displayed, giving "
"you a final chance to accept or reject the changes."
msgstr ""
"Ovi podaci mogu biti izmjenjeni, a izmjene mogu biti primijenjene na samo "
"jedan primjerak rasporeda ili na sve buduće transakcije. Nakon provjere "
"ispravnosti unosa svih podataka, klikom na <guibutton>OK</guibutton> "
"dodajete transakciju u knjigu salda i ažurirate naredni rok za raspored. Ako "
"ste promijenili bilo koji od podataka vezan za transakciju, potvrda vaše "
"izmjene će biti prikazana, koja vam daje zadnju priliku da prihvatite ili "
"odbacite promjene."

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:417
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select what you want to do with the information presented and click "
"<guibutton>OK</guibutton> or <guibutton>Cancel</guibutton>."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite šta želite da uradite sa podacima koji su vam prikazani i kliknite "
"na <guibutton>OK</guibutton> ili <guibutton>Poništi</guibutton>."

#. Tag: title
#: details-schedules.docbook:424
#, no-c-format
msgid "Letting &kappname; enter the scheduled transaction(s) for you"
msgstr "Dopuštanje &kappname; da unese zakazane transakcije za vas"

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:426
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Alternatively, &kappname; can check which schedules are due upon startup and "
"enter them for you if the appropriate option was checked when setting up the "
"schedule."
msgstr ""
"Alternativno, &kappname; može provjeriti koji rasporedi su zakazani prilikom "
"pokretanja i unijeti ih umjesto vas ako je odabrana odgovarajuća opcija "
"prilikom uspostavljanja rasporeda."

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:432
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the option was not checked then &kappname; will open the previously "
"mentioned dialog and you can follow the steps mentioned there. &kappname; "
"will also open the dialog if the amount is an estimate so you can enter the "
"real amount."
msgstr ""
"Ako opcija nije odabrana &kappname;  će onda otvoriti prethodno pomenuti "
"dijalog i možete pratiti korake spomenute tamo. &kappname;  će također "
"otvoriti dijalog ako je iznos procjena, tako da možete unijeti stvarni iznos."

#. Tag: para
#: details-schedules.docbook:439
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can also opt to have &kappname; not check which transactions are "
"scheduled on startup by deselecting the option in the Settings dialog and "
"any overdue transaction or transactions due 'today' will be shown in the "
"Home view for you to enter manually."
msgstr ""
"Također možete odabrati da &kappname; ne provjerava koje su transakcije "
"zakazane prilikom pokretanja tako što nećete odabrati opciju u dijalogu "
"postavki, pa će sve transakcije koje su probile rok ili transakcije zakazane "
"za 'danas'  biti prikazane u početnom prikazu, i biće vam dozvoljeno da ih "
"unesete ručno."
